"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3weeks,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "then 25mg 24hourly until completion of TB dose."}]}, {"id": "body-06800", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Multiple sclerosis (MS) is an inflammatory demyelinating disease of the central nervous system. It is classified into different types based on disease course, including relapsing remitting MS, Secondary progressive MS, Primary progressive MS and Progressive relapsing MS", "runs": [{"text": "Multiple sclerosis (MS) is an inflammatory demyelinating disease of the central nervous system. It is classified into different types based on disease course, including relapsing remitting MS, Secondary progressive MS, Primary progressive MS and Progressive relapsing MS"}]}, {"id": "body-06802", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-06803", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Unilateral, painful vision loss with impaired color perception (Optic neuritis)", "runs": [{"text": "Unilateral,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "painful"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vision"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "loss"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "impaired"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "color"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "perception"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Optic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "neuritis)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1627"}}, {"id": "body-06804", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Subacute limb weakness", "runs": [{"text": "Subacute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "limb"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "weakness"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1627"}}, {"id": "body-06805", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Electric shock sensation on neck flexion (Lhermitte’s sign)", "runs": [{"text": "Electric"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "shock"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sensation"}, {"text": "